                                                   algorithm. Thus, resolving an open question of Buhrman et al. from 2002, there is no partial
                                                   Boolean function whose quantum query complexity is constant and whose randomized query
                                                   complexity is linear. We conjecture
                                                                                       that a natural generalization of Forrelation achieves the
